==Battleground==
*3 [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Duche]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*5 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*2 [[Mr. Mer]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Lutrinae Gokurakko]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 90~93.33 seconds<sup>2,700f~2,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Mr. Mole]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Cala Maria]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 136.67 seconds<sup>4,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use the Dogensteins and Duche at the beginning to build up some cash before the Angelic Gories spawn, preferably with Extra Money units like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]]. Start building up anti-Angel attackers for the Gokurakkos that spawn: [[Ancient Egg: N106 (Rare Cat)|Mushroom Cat]] works excellently here thanks to their Wave Immunity. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] can stall out almost every enemy here very well, and [[Food Stall Cat (Rare Cat)|Cafeteria Cat]] expedites the Angel slaughter process. Ideally, you want to clear out the first Mr. Mer quickly using [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]] and any other high-damage nukers you own, as this will become tricky later on. You can also time [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cats]] or [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]]s with a Wave Shield like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] to progressively chip at enemies behind the Mr. Mer.

Paired with [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Awakened Naala]] and [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Awakened Doron]], you can continuously stagger Mr. Mole and Cala Maria from the safety of cover. It's a war of attrition, so it may take a while, and you will have to deal with another Lutrinae Gokurakko eventually.

